window.products.push({"id":104062,"name":"Gas Oven Igniter Replacement Compatible with DG94-00520A, Gas Stove Igniter, Stove Parts for Gas Oven Igniter Heating Element by B&C Ecom LLC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yUv4cNwUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exact Replacement For Dg94-00520a Gas Oven Ignitor - This B&C Ecom LLC-0520A Gas Oven Igniter is equivalent to OEM specifications and standards and it fits the oven heating element for model DG94-00520A. This Igniter includes a connector that allows you to simply plug into your existing oven burner in the bottom of your gas range. One-Year Limited Warranty - A well-functioning oven igniter is an everyday essential, and you deserve a reliable igniter that works as good as the original did, or better. When you order from our small family-owned, vet-owned company, we assure you that your new igniter will get your stove working like a charm (if compatible). Please check the additional product details carefully to ensure that this part will fit your existing gas range before ordering. Durable, Reliable, High-Quality Parts - Save hundreds on labor and fancy brands when you install this premium part yourself. Old igniter out, new igniter in, and you’re ready to fire it up! This gas range oven burner igniter by B&C Ecom gets the job done at a quarter of the expense and performs to the highest standards as it always should. Family-Owned Business You Can Trust - When your gas igniter glows but refuses to light, your oven won’t start, or there is little to no heat when set to Bake, then your oven igniter may need to be replaced. This sturdy oven igniter replaces the DG94-00520A igniter part and takes just a few minutes to install and gets your oven working again. 30-Day Satisfaction Guaranteed Return Policy - At B&C Ecom, we promise to always provide extraordinary products and customer service at highly competitive rates. If your new B&C Ecom LLC-0520A Oven Igniter isn’t exactly what you needed, you can receive a refund if returned within 30 days. Order now to get your oven up and running again, or return this oven igniter at zero risk to you. [Caution] Handle with care: The igniter element replacement is highly fragile and sensitive. - Do Not Touch The igniter element dark grey/black under any circumstances. Extreme Cold Weather Shipment Warning: Please allow to warm up at room temperature before using.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yUv4cNwUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"B&CEcom LLC","source_asin":"B0BJ5N7Y1M","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-104062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ5N7Y1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ5N7Y1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
