window.products.push({"id":104191,"name":"ARLIME Compact Laundry Dryer, 1.6 cu.ft Portable Clothes Dryers W/4 Automatic Drying Mode, Small Electric Laundry Dryer W/Stainless Steel Drum & Contr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615BQUK55DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏘️【Effectively Removing Wrinkles】Featuring large-diameter stainless steel tumble, this portable laundry dryer adopts the forward and reverse tumble action with inner device for easy rotation to prevent tangling, effectively removing wrinkles and restoring the fluffy and comfortable fabrics in the moderate temperature. 🔇【Quiet and ENERGY】Equipped with a technologically advanced lint filter that is easy to clean to work efficiently and automatic shutoff to save energy. In order to provide a comfortable environment, the noise (ONLY 57 dB) of this clothes dryer is minimal.it won’t influence your normal conversation and sleeping. 👍【MULTIFUNCTION】Suitable for most clothes, you can set different modes according to different fabrics and weights: Cool(0-20mins): cool down the temperature, Warm(30-120mins): dry and cool cloth, Anti-wrinkle, Hot (120-200min): for drying large quantities or bulky item, Air dry(0-80mins) run with cool air to freshening. 💛【Compact /Portable/Large Capacity】This electric dryer with 850W power and 10 lbs large capacity，The weight of this clothes dryer is only 37.3lbs, and the small size makes it portable. It’s compact feature is perfect for small space like apartments, dormitories, motor homes, RV's, and more, it can be mounted on the wall, place on firm horizontal ground or mounted on the rack (the bracket is not include). 🚚【BEST SERVICES】We usually process the order within 24 hours and hand it to the courier operator. With confidence in quality of our product , ARLIME offers a 1-year manufacturer with your purchase of any of our product, Any questions please contact us, we will give you a satisfied answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615BQUK55DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARLIME","source_asin":"B0C27J8FXX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-104191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C27J8FXX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C27J8FXX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
