window.products.push({"id":104384,"name":"Waterdrop FXRC Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for GE® MXRC, FXRC, FXRT, HXRC, 9905, 46-9905 & 1E1013 (Package May Vary)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AMlJFQGhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Replacement for filter models] GE FXRC, MXRC, 1E1013, 46-9905, 9905, FXRT, HXRT. This Waterdrop refrigerator water filter replacement for MXRC, despite its affordable price, offers the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and great tasting water. Thanks to the Sri Lankan superior coconut shell carbon block, this filter is effective against various contaminants. [Perfect fit] You can now worry less about water leakages due to unfit or loose replacement refrigerator filters. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter replacement is made from an advanced industrial automation system and a precision measurement technology that ensures that you get the same fit as the original. Moreover, you need no tool to install this refrigerator water filter. Just follow the installation guidelines we have provided, and you will be done in minutes. [Top-notch filter material] Here, you are getting a significant improvement to the less-efficient charcoal filter that relies on coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell to filter water. The filter material in this filter is a 100% Sri Lankan selected coconut shell carbon block, with 2x larger surface area and more micropores. Unlike the cheap and mixed carbon block, the filter material in the Waterdrop refrigerator filter improves the overall taste of your water. [Complimentary month install stickers] You do not have to go the extra mile to monitor your refrigerator filter’s lifespan. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter is shipped with complimentary month install stickers that help track the service life at all times. Now you know when you have exhausted the 300 gallons or 6 months of pure water, depending on the water conditions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AMlJFQGhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B06WVBW9CC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-104384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WVBW9CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WVBW9CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
