window.products.push({"id":104413,"name":"45 x 23 mm Printed Clear Perforated Shrink Band for Liquid Bottles of Many Types [Sealed for Your Protection] Fits 3/4\" to 1\" Diameter - Pack of 250","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S9T8Q62kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What you are purchasing here are 45 by 23mm (Layflat Dimensions) tamper seal shrink bands printed with sealed for your protection. These work best for various boston round bottles, tinctures, and many other liquid bottles. Directions: Place shrink band around the lid of the bottle that you will be shrinking it to. Apply heat with the use of a heat gun or heat tunnel. I don't recommend using a blow dryer; it's possible but not worth it unless you're only doing a small quantity of bottles. The shrink bands are easy to heat and durable. Have any questions at all about the shrink bands? Just send me a message and I'll get back to you as soon as I can!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S9T8Q62kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supplement and Supply","source_asin":"B09B8WCW89","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-104413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B8WCW89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B8WCW89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":104414,"name":"Auertech Ice Maker Countertop, Portable and Compact Ice Maker Machine with Ice Scoop and Basket, Make 26lbs ice in 24 Hrs, 9 Cubes Ready in 8 Mins, Pe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bYQdQUZ3L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【Efficient Ice Making】 Equipped with powerful compressors, premium copper aluminum fin condenser and refrigerant, enabling the ice maker to produce 9 ice cubes in 8 minutes. Auertech ice maker produces up to 26 pounds of ice per day. As the machine needs time to preheat like freezer, the effect of first or second time will be slightly less effective, it will be normal after a few more times. WARM NOTE: For normal use, please must let the machine stand upright for 12 hours before first use. 🧊【Smart & Quiet Ice Maker】 You can intuitively see the ice making process and the ice level through the transparent window. The smart light will remind you to add more water when the water runs out. When the ice basket is full of ice, the light will remind you to remove the ice cubes. Auertech ice machine is equipped with advanced refrigeration technology that can achieve low consumption while making ice with less than 38dB of noise. 🧊【Compact Ice Maker & Wide Applications】 The 9 x 12.6 x 13 inch size makes this compact ice machine suitable for most countertop. The lightweight and portable design makes it easy to store or carry. Perfect for kitchen, office, party, bar, camping, barbecue, RV. No matter where you are, our ice maker provides you with fresh and quality ice every day. 🧊【Two Sizes & Bullet Shape】 Smooth bullet-shaped ice, not easy to melt and stick together, will not hurt your mouth. Our countertop ice machine is available in two ice cube sizes and is ideal for cooling drinks, food and first aid. Plug in, add water, press the ON button, select the size of the ice. Enjoy the fresh ice! 🧊【Complete Accessories & Premium Service】 ETL certified. Comes with a removable ice basket and ice spoon for easy transfer of ice. The ice machine does not require installation and is made of food-grade materials. The ABS shell is smooth and easy to clean. Besides, with an outlet and drain plug at the bottom, easy to empty the unused water. WARM NOTE: Feel free to contact us if you have any problems, we will respond within 24hrs and resolve the problems as the way you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bYQdQUZ3L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Auertech","source_asin":"B08F7NK5G1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-104414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7NK5G1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7NK5G1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
