window.products.push({"id":104505,"name":"Giantex Full Automatic Washing Machine, 2 in 1 Portable Laundry Washer 1.5Cu.Ft 11lbs Capacity Washer and Spinner Combo 8 Programs 10 Water Levels Ene","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ScUBpU5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👚〖Intelligent Full-Automatic Technology〗: This washing machine has achieved full-automatic operation, from soak, wash, rinse, spin, to stop. At normal mode, it can also select the right water level automatically according to the clothes amount, allowing you to be spared from the troublesome operation. 💌💌This washing machine can not be 100% dry, only 90% dry, still need to be hung in the sunshine for dry. 👗〖High-Efficient 360°Tumbling Washing〗: Our washing machine features a stainless steel inner barrel, with small holes dotted for water to pass through. It will rotate during the process, making clothes tumble as manual washing does for a thorough and high-efficient cleaning. 👖〖8 Programs & 10 Water Levels〗: The high-performance washing machine provides you with 8 different choices to treat your clothes accordingly. And the wide range of 10 water levels will meet the needs based on your laundry load. With this multi-functional washing machine, you will get a tailor-made service for more convenience. 🧦〖1.5 Cu.Ft 11 lbs Large Washing Capacity〗: Compared with other washing machines, ours has an advantage for its large capacity. 1.5 Cu.Ft makes it possible to hold approximately 11 lbs clothes at once. Whether it is coat, shirt, underwear or sheet, it will exert its functions to meet the needs of the whole family. 👶〖Top Load Lid & Safe Child Lock〗: Features an automatic unbalance detection mechanism, this washing machine can correct imbalance in the tub automatically to avoid drastic vibration if the clothes were not distributed equally. Also, the child lock is helpful to prevent kids from touching it by mistake. Side handle design makes it convenient for you to move the washer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ScUBpU5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B093XZ6HYB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-104505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093XZ6HYB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B093XZ6HYB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
