window.products.push({"id":104689,"name":"Pour Over Coffee Filter - Metal Coffee Filter Coffee Dripper Reusable Coffee Filters Coffee Metal Filter Stainless Steel Tea Filter Portable Coffee Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VIuN1ZdzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOW TO USE ? Pour hot water over the dripper to preheat it.Remove the water; fill with grounded coffee, tapping the edges.Set unit over the designated cup or pot.Pour 10% of water across the cones.Add rest of water slowly in a circular motion, keeping the water level consistent.Wait for the water to brew.Remove the filter from the cup or pot.Dump the grounds, scrub the filter, & serve from the cup.The best coffee in the world is made when you take the time to brew it with a JAKATO Coffee Dripper! WHAT IS A BALANCED COFFEE TASTE ? The aroma of coffee describes the unique aroma and taste characteristics of coffee, flavor, acidity, aroma, bitterness, sweetness and aftertaste fusion and overall feeling. Many of the best coffees in the world are balanced. The ultra-fine double sieve and the unique cone-shaped dripper can extract coffee powder at an appropriate water flow rate to help achieve a balanced flavor. MAKE A DELICIOUS SINGLE CUP AT HOME . Don't waste money or sacrifice taste. Our drippers are paperless and will not absorb essential oils such as filter paper.You can brew it in a carafe or thermos to save time and money.Enjoy your time enjoying coffee and make a cup according to your unique and personal preferences.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VIuN1ZdzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JAKATO","source_asin":"B08FXHCVW9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-104689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FXHCVW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FXHCVW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
