window.products.push({"id":104758,"name":"SMETA Portable Ice Maker Machine Countertop 39LBs Ice/24H Stainless Steel, Bullet Ice Cubes in 8 Mins, Chewable Crunchy Style Ice Crusher and Cube Mak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LLr3teUcL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH-QUALITY ICE CUBES - SMETA’s countertop ice maker machine can produces 10 Bullet ice cubes per cycle (every 8 to 10 minutes). That means you can make up to 36 pounds of ice cubes every 24 hours. Best of all, you can adjust the thickness of the ice cubes according to your needs, letting you create perfect drinks. (Please clean your ice machine regularly) DIGITAL DISPLAY-INTUITIVE OPERATION - Electronic controls for ease of use. Features an easy-to-read push-button digital design for a comfortable use. Offers on-time ice production. When there is not enough water in the water tank, the indicator will light up, reminding you to add more water. Or when the ice bucket is full, the ice maker it will remind you to remove the extra ice cubes, so the ice maker can start to make more ice. WATER RECYCLING SYSTEM - Counter ice maker machine holds up to 2.2 liters of water, minimizing how often you need to refill it. When filled, it can produce 5 cycles of ice cubes, making 50 ice cubes! It contains a recycling system, collecting melted water and filtering it to be reused ensuring that no water is wasted. It may sound high-tech, but all you have to do is open the cover of the water reservoir, pour in water, and you are ready to start making delicious ice cubes. USER-FRIENDLY & QUIET COOLING - Portable ice maker countertop top rated prime is equipped with the most advanced refrigeration technology. We use efficient compressors in order to ensure that your ice maker will produce the highest quality ice cubes. Best ice makers countertop are equipped with a quick and quiet cooling system and well-insulated interior. This not only helps you save energy, but it also keeps nugget ice machine cool and ensures a quiet environment. Compact Chewable Crunchy Style - This Portable Countertop Ice Maker keeps you in a steady supply of ice for entertaining at home or everyday use. This compact ice maker looks great in your kitchen, but is also versatile enough to make 3 sizes of ice for any occasion. If you are an ice eater, the ice cubes are just fit you, plus the ice when left in the machine recycles itself, so you don’t waste water. You will be happy with the purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LLr3teUcL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMETA","source_asin":"B0B91WRR78","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-104758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B91WRR78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B91WRR78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
