window.products.push({"id":104782,"name":"279838 Whirlpool Dryer Heating Element 279816 Thermal Fuse Kit by Blutoget-Fit for Whirlpool Ken-more Cabrio May-tag Amana Dryer-Replaces 279837 45310","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XNSZOGzcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Durable Nickel-chromium Alloy ✅【UPGRADED 279838 DRYER HEATING ELEMENT KIT 】279838 whirlpool dryer heating element is strung with a coiled wire that is made out of a nickel and chrome alloy. W10724237 dryer heating element with upgraded heating technology , WED4815EW1 heating element nickel chromium content reaches 90%, 279838 allows the heating element to produce more intensive energy.Nickel wire is 0.052in thick ,and the length of the heating wire is 30% longer than other common dryer replacement parts -last long time. 4531017 Dryer Heating Element is rated at 5400 Watts 240 Volts and has 2- 5/16\" male terminals. ✅【Packaging includes 】:Includes 1x W10724237 dryer heating element, 1 x 279816 thermostat kit for dryer. The rated power of W10724237 is 5400 Watts 240 Volts and has 2- 5/16\" male terminals. Whirlpool 279816 includes one high-limit thermostat with a limit of 250 degrees Fahrenheit, and one thermal cut-off fuse (309 degrees), jumper wires, and new female spade terminals , 279838 Heating Element for whirlpool dryer can solve these problems that dryer no heat or not enough heat, takes too long to dry. ✅【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】:W10724237 Whirlpool Dryer Heating Element perfect compatible for Whirlpool WED4815EW1, Kenmore 70 80 90 300 400 500 600 series model 110, Maytag MEDC200XW3 , Kitchen-Aid, Roper RED4440VQ1, Amana NED4600YQ1, Inglis, Admiral, Magic Chef Dryer. This 279838 dryer replacement parts directly replaces W10724237, 2438, 279837, 279838, 279838A, 279838VP, 3398064, 3403585, 8565582, AP3094254. ✅【FIT MODELS】:279838 Heating element for whirlpool dryer wed5300sq0 , wed4800bq1, wed5300sq0 , wed5100vq1 , wed5000dw2, wed4800xq0 , wed4815ew1. 279838 compatible for kenmore 70 80 90 300 400 500 600 series model 110, 11065132410, 11061202011,11060202990, 11060212990, 11060222510, 11060522900. For Maytag Dryer Heating Element medc215ew1, medc400vw0, medx655dw1, medc200xw1. For Roper Dryer Heating Element red4640yq0 heating element, red4440vq1, red4516fw0 , red4640yq1, red4516fw0 . ✅【2 YEARS GUARANTEE】:Risk-free shopping, 279838 whirlpool dryer heating element is made of premium quality material,quality assurance and efficient service,supports 2 YEARS return and exchange.High quality, good price, high speed Amazon official logistics. If you are dissatisfied with the product, Contact us! We will show you a sincere attitude and satisfactory solution.We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】:279838 whirlpool dryer heating element is easy to install. Please note that the power should be turned off before installation.After diagnosing with meter. Removed the back of the dryer after unplugging the dryer.Removed the three wires to the element and thermostat,then removed the 279838 4531017 Dryer Heating Element and removed the thermostat from the heating element and installed the new thermal fuse for whirlpool dryer. Put the back of the dryer back on, hooked the vent hose back to the dryer,plugged it back in, and put 279838 dryer heating element kit on cycle and then there was great.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XNSZOGzcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blutoget","source_asin":"B09TVK6BLK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-104782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TVK6BLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TVK6BLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
