window.products.push({"id":105000,"name":"Waterdrop ADQ36006101 Replacement for LG® LT700P® Refrigerator Water Filter, Kenmore® 9690, 469690, ADQ36006102, LFXS30766S, RFC1200A, FML-3 and LT120","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e7AwJIp3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The replacement for Kenmore water filter 9690, 46-9690 and LFXS30766S water filter, despite the affordable price, offer the best - a mix of prior filtration performance and important certifications from the well-known regulatory body in the industry – NSF 42 and NSF 372 certificates. Thanks to the 100% Sri Lankan superior coconut shell carbon block, the replacement for LG -LT700P & LFXS30766S refrigerator water filter can effective against various impurities. [Advance filtration process] Waterdrop water filters effectively filters off contaminants from your water. At the same time, complimentary air filter efficiently absorb volatile organic compounds and remove impurity particle from your refrigerator. [Perfect fit] You can now worry less about water leakages due to unfit or loose replacement refrigerator filters. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter replacement is made from an advanced industrial automation system and a precision measurement technology that ensures that you get the same fit as the original. Moreover, you need no tool to install this refrigerator water filter. Just follow the installation guidelines we have provided, and you will be done in minutes. [Top-notch filter material] Unlike the less-efficient charcoal filter that relies on coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell. This filter adopts 100% Sri Lankan selected coconut shell carbon block, with 2x larger surface area and more micropores, which can improve the taste of your water. [Complimentary month install stickers] You do not have to go the extra mile to monitor your refrigerator filter’s lifespan. This Waterdrop refrigerator filter is shipped with complimentary month install stickers that help track the service life at all times. Now you know when you have exhausted the 200 gallons or 6 months of pure water, depending on the water conditions. [BPA-free and food-grade materials] At Waterdrop, we prioritize your safety. This is why we have used only safe materials in this refrigerator filter, as verified by the NSF 372 certification for lead-free materials. [Purified with love] We believe everyone has the right to drink pure water wherever they are. We are not only about business; we hope to use our technology to benefit more people. A portion of every purchase you make is donated to provide children in water-scarce regions in Africa with clean, pure water. [Replacement for models] This filter replacement for: LG LT700P, LT700PCS, ADQ36006101, ADQ36006101-S, ADQ36006101S, ADQ36006102, ADQ36006102-S, ADQ36006102S, 9690, 46-9690, KENMORE 469690, WSL-3, WF700, WLF-01, RFC1200A, CWMF041, BLS LT700P, APF1400, PL-500, WF-117, R-9690, WD-F32, OP-1200A. [Compatible with] LFCS31626S; LFD20786SB; LFD22786SB; LFX21976ST; LFX25976SB; LFX25978SB; LFX25991ST; LFX25992ST; LFX28968D; LFX28978SB; LFX28979SB; LFX28991ST; LFX28992ST; LFX28995ST; LFX29927SB; LFX29937ST; LFX29945ST; LFX31915SB; LFX31925SB; LFX31935ST; LFX31945ST; LFX31945ST; LFX31995ST; LFX32945ST; LFX33975ST; LFXC24726D; LFXC24766; LFXC24766S; LFXS24623B; LFXS24663S. LG is a registered trademark of LG CORP.  LG is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e7AwJIp3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B07HPZ9CKM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-105000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HPZ9CKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HPZ9CKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":105001,"name":"Kenmore 28\" Top-Load Washer with Triple Action Impeller and 5.3 Cubic Ft. Total Capacity, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vBPPmcpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get clothes, bedding, and sports uniforms cleaner with the Kenmore Top-Load Washer. This deep cleaning, high efficiency washer can tackle all of your laundry needs while reducing your water and energy usage. It's 5.3 cubic foot capacity can handle the tough stuff, like jeans, bulky bedding, and comforters, saving you a trip to the laundromat to use the jumbo washers. The washing machine also features a built-in water faucet, which reduces the need to pre-treat stains before washing. You can conveniently load detergent and fabric softener in the dispenser drawer at the beginning of the cycle, and it will add each at just the right time in the cycle. The integrated impeller uses 9 spray jets and 3 unique wash actions to keep your apparel, sheets, and more moving during the wash cycle for a thorough cleaning. Plus, the direct drive motor provides spin speeds up to 850 RPM to remove more moisture from your clothes so they spend less time in the dryer. The top load washing machine allows you to conveniently load your clothes, towels, delicates, and more from the top for easy access to the water basin. With the LCD screen with capacitive touch controls, you can use the light-touch controls to select the load and cycle options you need to treat, clean, and freshen clothes your way. This Kenmore top loading washer is also ENERGY STAR certified to help save you money, while decreasing energy consumption. Spend less time hovering over your laundry machines with the Kenmore 5.3 Cubic Ft. Top Load Washer. The washer measures 27.25\" W x 27.88\" D x 42.5\" H and 58.5\" H when the lid is open for a perfect fit in your laundry room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vBPPmcpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenmore","source_asin":"B092MGT9YP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-105001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092MGT9YP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B092MGT9YP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
